OL,2,V55555555CBY-ELECTION: LABOUR
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CTO WIN, SAYS POLL
OL,4,         C
OL,5, Labour is on course for a thumping
OL,6, victory in the Mid-Staffordshire by-
OL,7, election, according to a MORI poll for
OL,8, The Sunday Times.
OL,10, It says Labour is poised to demolish a
OL,11, 14,654 Tory majority and romp home with
OL,12, 5,000 votes to spare.
OL,14, The poll gives Labour 50% support and
OL,15, the Tories 36%. The Liberal Democrats
OL,16, with 5% and the SDP and Greens, both 4%
OL,17, would all lose their deposits.
OL,19, MORI's figures say the 20% swing to
OL,20, Labour would give the party its biggest
OL,21, by-election success since 1933.
OL,23,F]DFrom 03-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
