OL,2,V55555555CFORD STAFF TO
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CRETURN TO WORK
OL,5, Production workers at Ford's Halewood
OL,6, plant on Merseyside have agreed to
OL,7, return to work - and cross craftsmen's
OL,8, picket lines.
OL,10, A mass meeting of 7,000 staff agreed to
OL,11, end the seven-week-old dispute on
OL,12, Monday in the first strike-breaking
OL,13, move in the plant's 30-year history.
OL,15, It means that 500 craftsmen who voted
OL,16, earlier this week to stay out on strike
OL,17, face a showdown with their workmates.
OL,19, The shop floor staff heard a return-to-
OL,20, work recommendation from the TGWU but
OL,21, no formal vote was taken.
OL,23,F]DFrom 03-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
