OL,2,V55555555CLIVERPOOL AMBULANCE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CRANSACKED
OL,5, An ambulance used by a crew still
OL,6, working in Liverpool has been ransacked
OL,7, after answering an emergency call.
OL,9, Many 999 staff in the city are on
OL,10, strike over the current pay deal and
OL,11, there were shouts of "scabs" as the
OL,12, ambulance arrived at Walton Hospital.
OL,14, When the crew returned to the vehicle
OL,15, they found the radio, oxygen cylinders
OL,16, and other equipment had been ripped out
OL,18, Merseyside Ambulance Service said it
OL,19, did not know if those responsible "had
OL,20, anything to do" with the 999 service.
OL,23,F]DFrom 03-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
