OL,2,V55555555CMISSING CLIMBERS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CMAKE OWN WAY HOME
OL,5, A huge land and air search for two
OL,6, missing climbers was called off when it
OL,7, was discovered they had made their own
OL,8, way home.
OL,10, An RAF mountain rescue team from
OL,11, Kinloss was called in amid fears that
OL,12, they could have been trapped by
OL,13, avalanches in the Cairngorms.
OL,15, Tony Page, 31, and Allan Coombes, 35,
OL,16, both single from North Wales, had been
OL,17, missing at Tomintoul since early this
OL,18, morning.
OL,20, Police at Inverness said they returned
OL,21, to where they were staying unaware of
OL,22, the search going on for them.
OL,23,F]DFrom 03-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
